        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It is agreed by the parties hereto, that pre and/or post inspection assignments will remain in the General Service Technician classification. It is further agreed by the parties that if the Company is required to undertake a major project, e.g., retrofit, the Company, after it has utilized all of the available employees in the General Service Technician classification for the project, may fulfill its additional manpower needs for said project with employees in the Service Technician classification.",
